          <tbody>
            <tr style="background: var(--theme-surface); border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);"><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Minimum order quantity</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">1 piece</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">Based on the production order</span></td></tr>
            <tr style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 2%, var(--theme-surface)); border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);"><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Indicative lead time</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">5–7 working days</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">3–4 weeks</span></td></tr>
            <tr style="background: var(--theme-surface); border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);"><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Typical objective</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">Validate fit, weld prep, surface finish, corrosion prep</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">Repeatable output against the approved drawing and inspection plan</span></td></tr>
            <tr style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 2%, var(--theme-surface)); border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);"><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Surface preparation</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">ASTM B600 cleaning / pickling per the agreed route</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">Scheduled per the approved process route</span></td></tr>
            <tr style="background: var(--theme-surface); border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);"><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="font-bold text-sm" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Material documentation</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">As agreed in the purchase specification</span></td><td class="px-5 py-4 align-top"><span class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 80%, transparent);">MTR and traceability documentation per the order</span></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs italic leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Lead times are planning targets, not automatic guarantees. They begin after the required technical information, material availability, order approval, and production arrangements are confirmed. Welded-assembly machining, external surface preparation, and customer-supplied material may affect the schedule.</p>
