            <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-xl text-sm font-black shrink-0" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--theme-primary), color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 70%, #000)); color: #0F172A;">2</span><div><h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--theme-text);">DFM and Corrosion-Service Feasibility</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">We identify potential machining constraints, weld distortion allowances, surface preparation requirements, and any information needed to finalize the process route.</p></div></li>
